  "body": "See https://github.com/WICG/web-share/issues/12#issuecomment-314962505. We currently have three typedefs that can serve as \"image sources\", but they are spread throughout the spec in a confusing way. I think they should be given a dedicated section, perhaps with advice on when to use each. (Although that advice might be something like \"always use the maximal one\".)",
